$, the margin left at risk","They are equal, since $G$ is set by $\\frac{b}{b+h}$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"7369d1d88fa61429556d6fef","time_limit":45,"curation_status":"retired","retired_at":"2026-10-27T08:58:47.943104+00:00","reason_code":"duplicate_diagnostic_target"}]}}